  "ruleText": "He-P 601.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to set forth the procedures and requirements for operating as an other qualified agency pursuant to RSA 161-I.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes # 1 and #2 at chapter heading for He-P 600) #9898-A, eff 3-29-11, EXPIRED: 3-29-19\n\nNew. #13115, eff 10-1-20",
